nt: 0,0:00:39.94,0:00:43.56,Lyrics,,0,0,0,karaoke,Don't turn a blind eyeComment: 0,0:00:43.56,0:00:50.04,Lyrics,,0,0,0,karaoke,Common sense is only what the majority says it is!Comment: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:54.08,Lyrics,,0,0,0,karaoke,It's not like we've seenComment: 0,0:00:54.07,0:00:57.41,Lyrics,,0,0,0,karaoke,the end of the world with our own eyes.Comment: 0,0:00:57.41,0:01:01.96,Lyrics,,0,0,0,karaoke,So let's go, Captain I'll-Do-It-My-Way!Comment: 0,0:01:01.96,0:01:04.72,Lyrics,,0,0,0,karaoke,Whaddya mean, "no can do"?Comment: 0,0:01:04.71,0:01:07.89,Lyrics,,0,0,0,karaoke,We haven't even started yet!Comment: 0,0:01:07.88,0:01:12.72,Lyrics,,0,0,0,karaoke,I wanna know it all!  Now, yes, we can!Comment: 0,0:01:12.72,0:01:18.68,Lyrics,,0,0,0,karaoke,Yes, we can!  You can!  This moment...Comment: 0,0:01:19.06,0:01:24.10,Lyrics,,0,0,0,karaoke,We can!  I can!  With this feeling of freedom...Comment: 0,0:01:24.39,0:01:31.32,Lyrics,,0,0,0,karaoke,Now...  Now, oh yes, we can!Comment: 0,0:01:37.34,0:01:38.64,Lyrics,,0,0,0,karaoke,Yes, we can!Comment: 0,0:01:35.34,0:01:37.34,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Comment: 0,0:00:00.82,0:00:03.67,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Kono sekai no hate nanteComment: 0,0:00:03.64,0:00:06.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Kono me de mita wake janaiComment: 0,0:00:06.82,0:00:13.95,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Dakara tabidatsun da kimi to, WII KYAN!Comment: 0,0:00:23.67,0:00:27.00,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Umi kara umi wo mata ni kaketeComment: 0,0:00:29.06,0:00:31.91,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Daremo ga waratteiru kedoComment: 0,0:00:31.92,0:00:38.78,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Souzou tsukanaikoto bakari daroComment: 0,0:00:39.94,0:00:43.56,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Miteminufuri suruna yoComment: 0,0:00:43.56,0:00:50.04,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Joushiki nante sa tasuuketsuComment: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:54.08,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Kono sekai no hate nanteComment: 0,0:00:54.07,0:00:57.41,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Kono me de mita wake janaiComment: 0,0:00:57.41,0:01:01.96,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Dakara ikou ze AMANO JYAKKU senchouComment: 0,0:01:01.96,0:01:04.72,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Dekiyashinai koto tte nani?Comment: 0,0:01:04.71,0:01:07.89,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Mada nani mo hajimatte naiComment: 0,0:01:07.88,0:01:12.72,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Subete shiritain da ima, IESU WII KYANComment: 0,0:01:12.72,0:01:18.68,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,IESU WII KYAN! YUU KYAN! Kono shunkanComment: 0,0:01:19.06,0:01:24.10,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,WII KYAN! AI KYAN! Kono kaikanComment: 0,0:01:24.39,0:01:31.32,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Ima ima, OO IESU WII KYAN!Comment: 0,0:01:37.34,0:01:38.64,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,IESU WII KYAN!Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.82,Kanji,,0,0,0,,Comment: 0,0:00:00.82,0:00:03.67,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,この世｜せ界｜か#｜いの果｜はてなんてComment: 0,0:00:03.64,0:00:06.82,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,この目｜めで見｜みたわけじゃないComment: 0,0:00:06.82,0:00:13.95,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,だから旅｜た#｜び立｜!だつんだ 君｜き#｜みとウィーキャン！Comment: 0,0:00:23.67,0:00:27.00,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,海｜う#｜みから海｜う#｜みを股｜ま#｜たにかけてComment: 0,0:00:29.06,0:00:31.91,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,誰｜だ#｜れもが笑｜わ#｜らっているけどComment: 0,0:00:31.92,0:00:38.78,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,想｜そう像｜!ぞ#｜うつかない真｜こ実｜!とばかりだろComment: 0,0:00:39.94,0:00:43.56,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,見｜みて見｜みぬ振｜ふりするなよComment: 0,0:00:43.56,0:00:50.04,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,常｜じょ#｜う識｜!し#｜きなんてさ 多｜た数｜!す#｜う決｜!け#｜つComment: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:54.08,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,この世｜せ界｜か#｜いの果｜はてなんてComment: 0,0:00:54.07,0:00:57.41,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,この目｜めで見｜みたわけじゃないComment: 0,0:00:57.41,0:01:01.96,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,だから行｜いこうぜ アマノジャック船｜せん長｜!ちょうComment: 0,0:01:01.96,0:01:04.72,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,出｜で来｜!きやしないことって何｜な#｜に？Comment: 0,0:01:04.71,0:01:07.89,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,まだ何｜な#｜にも始｜は#｜じまってないComment: 0,0:01:07.88,0:01:12.72,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,すべて知｜しりたいんだ 今｜い#｜まイエス・ウィーキャン！Comment: 0,0:01:12.72,0:01:18.68,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,イエス・ウィーキャン！ユー・キャン！ この瞬｜しゅ#｜ん間｜!か#｜んComment: 0,0:01:19.06,0:01:24.10,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,ウィーキャン！アイキャン！ この快｜か#｜い感｜!か#｜んComment: 0,0:01:24.39,0:01:31.32,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,今｜い#｜ま 今｜い#｜ま オー・イエス・ウィーキャン！Comment: 0,0:01:37.34,0:01:38.64,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,イエス・ウィーキャン！Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.08,0:01:46.27,Title,,0,0,0,,Luffy vs. Commander CrackerDialogue: 0,0:01:43.30,0:01:46.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Hmph! What an insolent brat!Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.25,0:01:50.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Look at this sword! Isn't it something?Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.42,0:01:55.68,Main,,0,0,0,,It's called Pretzel! It's a one-of-a-kind sword!Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.68,0:02:00.16,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll teach you a lesson about the roughness of the New World!Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.64,0:02:05.52,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! A one-of-a-kind sword?! But you've got six!Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.85,0:02:09.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's run for now, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.60,0:02:11.78,Main,,0,0,0,,No way!Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.92,0:02:37.63,Main,,0,0,0,,You fools have got nowhere to run!Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.18,0:02:43.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn!Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.53,0:03:41.26,Main,,0,0,0,,That's my brother!Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.26,0:03:42.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy...Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.38,0:04:01.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.51,0:04:06.35,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,They're members of an Emperor's crew! We underestimated them!Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.45,0:04:10.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Even Luffy's having a hard time with her underling!Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.56,0:04:13.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Run!Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.06,0:04:17.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-What the...Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.03,0:04:24.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop there! I'll deal with you two!Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.32,0:04:26.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Me too-ju!Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.76,0:04:52.22,Main,,0,0,0,,I know how you feel. You just got scared, didn't you?Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.52,0:04:57.60,Main,,0,0,0,,The Worst Generation? What's so "worst" about it?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.60,0:05:01.53,Main,,0,0,0,,After being puffed up in the first half of the Grand Line,Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.53,0:05:09.08,Main,,0,0,0,,lots of crews have come here and been certain that their captain would be Pirate King, only to be disappointed by the result.Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.08,0:05:11.24,Main,,0,0,0,,I've witnessed it first-hand!Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.95,0:05:18.79,Main,,0,0,0,,In the past two years, many of them have come wandering into Mama's territory.Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.79,0:05:21.00,Main,,0,0,0,,"Captain" Kid.Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.00,0:05:22.98,Main,,0,0,0,,"Roar of the Sea" Apoo.Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.98,0:05:24.78,Main,,0,0,0,,"Gang" Bege.Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.78,0:05:27.55,Main,,0,0,0,,"Mad Monk" Urouge.Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.55,0:05:33.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Aside from Bege, who wisely realized he was out of his depth and joined our crew,Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.47,0:05:41.32,Main,,0,0,0,,the rest were all tossed out, without ever getting to see or speak to Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.87,0:05:45.02,Main,,0,0,0,,The only one to make any progress was...Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.02,0:05:47.40,Main,,0,0,0,,... "Mad Monk" Urouge!Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.66,0:05:53.54,Main,,0,0,0,,He was impudent enough to defeat one of the Sweet Commanders!Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.54,0:05:57.29,Main,,0,0,0,,They were the Four Sweet Commanders until not so long ago.Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.92,0:06:00.83,Main,,0,0,0,,But that's as far as he got.Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.83,0:06:04.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama was furious, and sent Cracker to crush him!Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.84,0:06:07.63,Main,,0,0,0,,He had nowhere to run!Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.63,0:06:11.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I bet he's dead in a ditch right now!Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.54,0:06:19.60,Main,,0,0,0,,She disappeared!Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.76,0:06:31.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen!Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.62,0:06:35.45,Main,,0,0,0,,This is your brick wall in the New World.Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.92,0:06:46.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Trying to fight the Four Emperors? You must be dreaming!Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.57,0:06:49.32,Main,,0,0,0,,You'll never even see Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.32,0:06:53.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Infiltrate the tea party? Stop the wedding?Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.85,0:06:59.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Taking your crewmate back?! All of that is a dream!Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.27,0:07:05.15,Main,,0,0,0,,You have no hope of even catching sight of Mama's face... You will die in this forest!Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.65,0:07:10.32,Main,,0,0,0,,M-My Tact...Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.91,0:07:17.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, come to the Mirro-World!Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.38,0:07:20.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.38,0:07:26.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Come on! Come on! Come to me!Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.13,0:07:31.51,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll have plenty of time to cut up your face and body in here...Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.51,0:07:32.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Pound-chan!Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.84,0:07:38.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Just give up!Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.93,0:07:41.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Let go of her, Brûlée!Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.46,0:07:55.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you!Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.28,0:07:57.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Father Pound!Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.28,0:08:01.41,Main,,0,0,0,,No, it's just Pound, now! What you've just done is treason against Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.00,0:08:05.08,Main,,0,0,0,,You're a dead man! No one will save you now!Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.43,0:09:03.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Brûlée will come back.Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.56,0:09:09.40,Main,,0,0,0,,She can show up in any place that has a mirror.Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.40,0:09:12.11,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. You did it to help me!Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.00,0:09:19.03,Main,,0,0,0,,I was targeted to be killed anyway.Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.03,0:09:21.53,Main,,0,0,0,,By my ex-wife.Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.20,0:09:28.79,Main,,0,0,0,,By the way, are you Lola's friend?Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.79,0:09:29.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.26,0:09:43.91,Main,,0,0,0,,I see. It's no mistake!Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.91,0:09:47.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Lola's mama is Big Mom.Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.52,0:09:53.53,Main,,0,0,0,,The fact that those trees in the forest are afraid of this Vivre Card proves it.Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.28,0:09:58.45,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll make good use of it, Lola!Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.20,0:10:24.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! We'll get involved!Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.82,0:10:41.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't get so spread apart that you forget your Seducing Woods duties!Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.90,0:10:44.91,Main,,0,0,0,,There must never be an exit to the woods!Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.33,0:10:47.66,Main,,0,0,0,,O-Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.66,0:10:49.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Block his way!Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.11,0:11:25.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn! His Armament is too hard!Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.10,0:11:54.69,Main,,0,0,0,,If you consider Vinsmoke Sanji to be a friend, then leave him alone.Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.69,0:12:00.40,Main,,0,0,0,,He's a prince of a mighty kingdom. His status is far greater than yours!Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.49,0:12:07.12,Main,,0,0,0,,He will have a proud wife and live here...Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.91,0:12:10.70,Main,,0,0,0,,... with his every desire catered to!Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.01,0:12:22.34,Main,,0,0,0,,You selfishly claim you will take back your friend, rather than allowing him to be happy?Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.34,0:12:26.04,Main,,0,0,0,,When his annoying former captain finds him,Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.04,0:12:30.39,Main,,0,0,0,,that proud prince will no doubt say...Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.94,0:12:39.07,Main,,0,0,0,,"Begone from my sight, you miserable, lowlife pirate!"Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.24,0:13:35.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Muscle Balloon is a good name.Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.17,0:13:41.95,Main,,0,0,0,,But what can a balloon do?Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.30,0:13:45.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me say it one more time!Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.51,0:13:48.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Begone from my sight, you miserable, lowlife pirate!Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.08,0:14:29.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Cracker-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.74,0:14:36.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't insult Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.43,0:14:40.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if he's happy and doesn't want to come back,Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.02,0:14:44.44,Main,,0,0,0,,he'd never talk to us like that!Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.60,0:14:59.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go see Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.12,0:15:05.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't push your luck!Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.68,0:15:20.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Cracker-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.50,0:15:41.62,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.98,0:15:49.05,Main,,0,0,0,,You did a good job breaking...Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.05,0:15:51.30,Main,,0,0,0,,... my armor!Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.97,0:15:58.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Who are you?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.89,0:16:01.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Who am I?Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.25,0:16:06.11,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure I already introduced myself as "Sweet Commander Cracker".Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.11,0:16:11.11,Captions,,0,0,0,,"Thousand Arms" CrackerDialogue: 0,0:16:15.57,0:16:17.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I really liked that armor...Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.92,0:16:21.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Armor? No way! He coughed up blood!Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.16,0:16:23.87,Main,,0,0,0,,– That was jam! – Jam?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.87,0:16:28.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Since I'm a craftsman at heart, I also make sure that it tastes good.Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.33,0:16:34.59,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm a biscuitman with the powers of the Bis-Bis Fruit!Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.59,0:16:39.01,Main,,0,0,0,,I can produce and manipulate an infinite number of biscuits!Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.52,0:16:49.65,Main,,0,0,0,,To shape them into anything...Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.71,0:17:02.58,Main,,0,0,0,,And if I craft it carefully...Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.41,0:17:08.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Look! It's the face of a hardened warrior!Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.96,0:17:13.21,Main,,0,0,0,,The form that biscuits have taken...Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.21,0:17:16.89,Main,,0,0,0,,... has changed throughout history, depending on the baker.Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.89,0:17:22.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Very few people have forced me to reveal my true identity.Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.63,0:17:28.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Just look at the picture on my wanted poster, which was issued by the World Government.Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.26,0:17:31.69,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not me. It's my armor!Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.23,0:17:39.45,Main,,0,0,0,,I despise pain... I can't even stand the prick of a needle!Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.45,0:17:44.91,Main,,0,0,0,,And that's why I use my armor to fight.Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.91,0:17:50.54,Main,,0,0,0,,When I clap my hands, they multiply. That is the power and beauty of my biscuits...Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.54,0:17:54.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I have unlimited power at my disposal!Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.80,0:17:59.18,Main,,0,0,0,,You had to give your all to defeat...Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.18,0:18:05.81,Main,,0,0,0,,... a Biscuit Soldier that I can remake over and over.Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.81,0:18:11.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you understand now why you will never see Vinsmoke Sanji again?Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.32,0:18:15.69,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I will definitely return.Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.62,0:18:26.62,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna see Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.34,0:18:37.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Learning that there are people you can't beat no matter the effort you put in...Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.52,0:18:41.43,Main,,0,0,0,,... is a mark of true growth, brat!Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.77,0:18:50.23,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll teach you a lesson!Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.16,0:19:09.91,Main,,0,0,0,,– We can't do it! – We have no chance!Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.91,0:19:12.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Run!Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.02,0:19:24.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I guess we'll be safe here.Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.80,0:19:27.85,Main,,0,0,0,,We're no match for him!Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.85,0:19:29.39,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm here.Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.12,0:19:45.37,Main,,0,0,0,,When did she get there?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.79,0:19:50.37,Main,,0,0,0,,If you close your mouth, you'll be sealing your doom.Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.23,0:19:58.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if all of you shriveled up and withered away, I wouldn't care at all!Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.92,0:20:01.88,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.88,0:20:05.26,Main,,0,0,0,,You're a horrible person.Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.26,0:20:10.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Sweet Commander Cracker, or his mother, Big Mom the Emperor.Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.42,0:20:12.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Which is scarier?Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.50,0:20:14.44,Main,,0,0,0,,You're scarier than both of them!Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.53,0:20:22.57,Captions,,0,0,0,,Brûlée's Mirro-WorldDialogue: 0,0:20:30.65,0:20:35.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I see! I get the picture! Listen, Carrot!Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.52,0:20:42.26,Main,,0,0,0,,I have a great idea, so from now on, please call me Big Bro Chopper!Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.01,0:20:44.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh, okay.Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.68,0:20:45.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Good!Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.84,0:20:49.14,Main,,0,0,0,,And what is your idea, Chobro?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.14,0:20:51.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Chobro?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.10,0:20:55.44,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right! Short for Big Bro Chopper, Chobro!Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.81,0:20:59.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, okay.Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.70,0:21:01.84,Main,,0,0,0,,It seems like this world of mirrors...Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.84,0:21:05.64,Main,,0,0,0,,... is connected to all of the mirrors on Whole Cake Island!Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.64,0:21:08.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, I think you're right.Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.16,0:21:13.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Instead of escaping from here, we should take advantage of Brûlée's ability!Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.41,0:21:14.96,Main,,0,0,0,,How?Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.96,0:21:18.50,Main,,0,0,0,,We can look for Sanji through these mirrors!Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.50,0:21:21.30,Main,,0,0,0,,You're right! That's my Chobro!Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.91,0:21:27.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Your compliment doesn't make me happy, you fool!Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.18,0:21:32.64,Captions,,0,0,235,,The Capital of Whole Cake Island Sweet CityDialogue: 0,0:21:59.00,0:22:01.92,Main,,0,0,0,,– That went well. – Mm-hm.Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.92,0:22:06.38,Main,,0,0,0,,After it's done patrolling, the Biscuit Soldier will return to the castle storage room.Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.38,0:22:08.34,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll wait until then to make a move.Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.87,0:22:33.87,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll beat you up and go see Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.42,0:23:55.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Good morning!Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.80,0:24:00.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Today, the Vinsmoke Family will be coming to the castle,Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.45,0:24:02.96,Captions,,0,0,0,,Whole Cake ChateauDialogue: 0,0:24:00.16,0:24:02.96,Main,,0,0,0,,and then there will be an engagement ceremony, Mama.Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.96,0:24:05.92,Main,,0,0,0,,What about the wedding cake?Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.92,0:24:07.63,Main,,0,0,0,,That comes tomorrow.Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.84,0:24:13.51,Main,,0,0,0,,It's been one night.Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.51,0:24:16.64,Main,,0,0,0,,How are the mold spores holding up?Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.64,0:24:19.84,Main,,0,0,0,,This is their last chance to make contact with their friend.Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.84,0:24:24.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, please! How could you say that after you sent Cracker-sama?Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.94,0:24:31.28,Main,,0,0,0,,It's true that once Black Leg enters the castle, their chances of contact are essentially zero!Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.28,0:24:36.24,Main,,0,0,0,,After all, both the tea party and the wedding will be held in the castle.Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.24,0:24:40.29,Main,,0,0,0,,So they're all talk? Just like the others?Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.29,0:24:44.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Some of the Vinsmoke sons aren't here yet, right?Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.24,0:24:49.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, actually, I just received word that they have landed at the port.Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.96,0:24:49.48,Captions,,0,0,0,,The Germa KingdomDialogue: 0,0:24:51.38,0:24:53.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Good. They're here.Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.38,0:24:56.47,Main,,0,0,0,,My beloved sons!Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.47,0:25:00.06,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see them face off with Sanji.Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.94,0:25:20.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Welcome back!Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.27,0:25:29.50,Captions,,0,0,0,,Vinsmoke Ichiji – "Sparking Red" Eldest Son of the Vinsmoke FamilyDialogue: 0,0:25:34.82,0:25:40.05,Captions,,0,0,0,,Vinsmoke Niji – "Electric Blue" Second Son of the Vinsmoke FamilyDialogue: 0,0:25:43.79,0:25:47.60,Main,,0,0,0,,– Ichiji-sama! Niji-sama! – Nice to see you back from your long trip!Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.60,0:25:51.52,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe that you ended the long war on Broc Coli.Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.54,0:26:08.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Why isn't he coming out t